<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1501477656"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1542919809"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="シス×ラブ (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HoneyWorks / Kotoha / Hanon"/><amll:meta key="album" value="水声少女 (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:30.495"><div begin="00:00.355" end="03:30.495"><p begin="00:00.355" end="00:02.475" itunes:key="L1">一緒に怒られて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起被训斥</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni o ko ra re te</span></p><p begin="00:02.476" end="00:06.031" itunes:key="L2">一緒に大きくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起长大</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni o o ki ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:06.032" end="00:08.142" itunes:key="L3">一緒に涙して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni na mi da shi te</span></p><p begin="00:08.143" end="00:11.321" itunes:key="L4">その分もっと笑った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以此换来更多的欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no bu n mo 't to wa ra 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:23.273" end="00:25.437" itunes:key="L5">仲良しの姉妹で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲密无间的姐妹没有秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ka yo shi no shi ma i de ka ku shi go to ha na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:25.438" end="00:29.115" itunes:key="L6">隠し事はなかった</p><p begin="00:29.116" end="00:31.193" itunes:key="L7">好きな人の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想听你聊聊喜欢的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki na hi to no ha na shi i tsu ka ki ki ta i ka mo</span></p><p begin="00:31.194" end="00:34.863" itunes:key="L8">いつか聞きたいかも</p><p begin="00:34.864" end="00:36.983" itunes:key="L9">突然どうしたの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">突然间怎么了？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to tsu ze n do u shi ta no ？</span></p><p begin="00:36.984" end="00:40.636" itunes:key="L10">うちら仲良しだけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不是亲密无间吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u chi ra na ka yo shi da ke do</span></p><p begin="00:40.637" end="00:42.772" itunes:key="L11">大人になるほどね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是随着日渐长大</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na ni na ru ho do ne</span></p><p begin="00:42.773" end="00:45.588" itunes:key="L12">秘密増やしていいの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也该有更多的秘密嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu fu ya shi te i i no</span></p><p begin="00:46.509" end="00:49.317" itunes:key="L13">予想は芸能関係<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想 应该是娱乐圈里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so u ha ge i no u ka n ke i</span></p><p begin="00:49.318" end="00:52.142" itunes:key="L14">爽やかな王子様？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某位爽朗的王子殿下吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa wa ya ka na o u ji sa ma ？</span></p><p begin="00:52.143" end="00:55.091" itunes:key="L15">どうしよう…全然違うし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么办 完全不一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi yo u ze n ze n chi ga u shi</span></p><p begin="00:55.092" end="00:57.541" itunes:key="L16">だけどいいの王子様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但没关系 他就是我的王子殿下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do i i no o u ji sa ma</span></p><p begin="00:57.900" end="01:02.170" itunes:key="L17">ぶりっ子してほっぺつけてポーズ決めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故作可爱 脸贴着脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu ri 'k ko shi te ho 'p pe tsu ke te</span></p><p begin="01:02.171" end="01:03.646" itunes:key="L18">アップしよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摆好动作 然后上传吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po o zu ki me te a 'p pu shi yo u</span></p><p begin="01:03.647" end="01:07.943" itunes:key="L19">大好きだよ大好きだよ見つめ合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最喜欢你了 最喜欢你了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da yo da i su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="01:07.944" end="01:09.394" itunes:key="L20">可愛いねって<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me a 't te ka wa i i ne 't te</span></p><p begin="01:09.395" end="01:13.650" itunes:key="L21">苦手な事 得意な事 好みだとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不擅长的事 擅长的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ga te na ko to to ku i na ko to</span></p><p begin="01:13.651" end="01:15.157" itunes:key="L22">それぞれじゃん？<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go no mi da to ka so re zo re ja n ？</span></p><p begin="01:15.158" end="01:19.352" itunes:key="L23">嫌いだよ嫌いだよケンカしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌你 我也讨厌你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra i da yo ki ra i da yo</span></p><p begin="01:19.353" end="01:26.330" itunes:key="L24">ずっと一緒だよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算吵架 也要永远在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke n ka shi te mo zu 't to i 's sho da yo ne</span></p><p begin="01:26.331" end="01:28.685" itunes:key="L25">ルルリラ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Rururira</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ru ru ri ra</span></p><p begin="01:32.386" end="01:34.491" itunes:key="L26">こちらの彼ですが…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我的男朋友</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko chi ra no ka re de su ga</span></p><p begin="01:34.492" end="01:38.156" itunes:key="L27">お付き合いをしてます！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们正在交往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o tsu ki a i wo shi te ma su</span></p><p begin="01:38.157" end="01:40.280" itunes:key="L28">イメージ真逆でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算和想象完全不同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i me e ji ma gya ku de mo</span></p><p begin="01:40.281" end="01:43.853" itunes:key="L29">ちゃんと仲良くしてね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要好好相处哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cha n to na ka yo ku shi te ne</span></p><p begin="01:43.854" end="01:45.992" itunes:key="L30">取られたくないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想你被夺走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ra re ta ku na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:45.993" end="01:49.577" itunes:key="L31">少し拗ねてみたけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以试着闹了点别扭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi su ne te mi ta ke do</span></p><p begin="01:49.578" end="01:51.791" itunes:key="L32">ほんと楽しそうで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你似乎真的很开心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to ta no shi so u de</span></p><p begin="01:51.792" end="01:54.258" itunes:key="L33">私も嬉しくなった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也逐渐开心起来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi mo u re shi ku na 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:55.421" end="01:58.382" itunes:key="L34">気になる人とかいないの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你有在意的人吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ni na ru hi to to ka i na i no ？</span></p><p begin="01:58.383" end="02:01.219" itunes:key="L35">お姉ちゃんに教えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉姐姐吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne e cha n ni o shi e te</span></p><p begin="02:01.220" end="02:04.143" itunes:key="L36">決めたの恋愛は禁止<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我决定不谈恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki me ta no re n a i ha ki n shi</span></p><p begin="02:04.144" end="02:06.642" itunes:key="L37">今はダメ夢のため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少现在不行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha da me</span></p><p begin="02:06.761" end="02:10.935" itunes:key="L38">キメ顔して変顔して泣き笑いも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki me ga o shi te he n ga o shi te</span></p><p begin="02:10.936" end="02:12.558" itunes:key="L39">アップしよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有哭泣欢笑 全都上传吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ki wa ra i mo a 'p pu shi yo u</span></p><p begin="02:12.559" end="02:16.811" itunes:key="L40">大好きだよ大好きだよ見つめ合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最喜欢你了 最喜欢你了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da yo da i su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="02:16.812" end="02:18.393" itunes:key="L41">可愛いねって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互对视 真可爱呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me a 't te ka wa i i ne 't te</span></p><p begin="02:18.394" end="02:22.548" itunes:key="L42">似ているとか似てないとか趣味だってさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相似的地方 不相似的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni te i ru to ka ni te na i to ka</span></p><p begin="02:22.549" end="02:24.246" itunes:key="L43">それぞれじゃん？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有兴趣爱好 也各有不同吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shu mi da 't te sa so re zo re ja n ？</span></p><p begin="02:24.247" end="02:28.245" itunes:key="L44">嫌いだよ 嫌いだよ 仲直りも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌你 我也讨厌你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra i da yo ki ra i da yo</span></p><p begin="02:28.246" end="02:35.300" itunes:key="L45">きっとすぐできる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新和好一定也能立刻做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ka na o ri mo ki 't to su gu de ki ru</span></p><p begin="02:35.301" end="02:37.500" itunes:key="L46">ルルリラ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Rururira</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ru ru ri ra</span></p><p begin="02:41.564" end="02:47.438" itunes:key="L47">一つ屋根の下で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">同在一个屋檐下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu ya ne no shi ta de</span></p><p begin="02:47.439" end="02:52.683" itunes:key="L48">明日も騒ごう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天也要欢闹度过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta mo sa wa go u</span></p><p begin="02:52.811" end="02:57.002" itunes:key="L49">ぶりっ子してほっぺつけてポーズ決めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故作可爱 脸贴着脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu ri 'k ko shi te ho 'p pe tsu ke te</span></p><p begin="02:57.003" end="02:58.539" itunes:key="L50">アップしよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摆好动作 然后上传吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po o zu ki me te a 'p pu shi yo u</span></p><p begin="02:58.540" end="03:02.916" itunes:key="L51">大好きだよ大好きだよ見つめ合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最喜欢你了 最喜欢你了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da yo da i su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="03:02.917" end="03:04.350" itunes:key="L52">可愛いね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互对视 真可爱呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me a 't te ka wa i i ne</span></p><p begin="03:04.351" end="03:08.610" itunes:key="L53">苦手な事 得意な事 好みだとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不擅长的事 擅长的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ga te na ko to to ku i na ko to</span></p><p begin="03:08.611" end="03:10.159" itunes:key="L54">それぞれじゃん？<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go no mi da to ka so re zo re ja n ？</span></p><p begin="03:10.160" end="03:14.394" itunes:key="L55">嫌いだよ嫌いだよケンカしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌你 我也讨厌你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra i da yo ki ra i da yo</span></p><p begin="03:14.395" end="03:21.340" itunes:key="L56">ずっと一緒だよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算吵架 也要永远在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke n ka shi te mo zu 't to i 's sho da yo ne</span></p><p begin="03:21.341" end="03:30.495" itunes:key="L57">ルルリラ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Rururira</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ru ru ri ra</span></p></div></body></tt>